## AI run (M4-D05): messages when starting "Start AI analysis" (08 AI-020, AI-039)
ai-run-interrupted = Crawl was interrupted – resume or stop it first
ai-run-foreign = started by { $kind } (PID { $pid }) – control only there
ai-run-crawl-running = While the crawl is running, AI works along automatically.
ai-run-no-questions = No AI questions are active for this crawl.
ai-run-preview-off = The "AI (Preview)" switch is off.
ai-run-failed = The AI run could not start: { $detail }
ai-run-input-unavailable = Stored page content is missing for this question – crawl the pages again
